('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$HYBRID, PLUG-IN OR EV? Here is the one minute version. A hybrid, like the GWM Haval H6 Hybrid, charges its own small battery and never plugs in, so it suits you if you cannot charge at home. A plug-in hybrid, like the Mitsubishi Outlander PHEV, runs short trips on electricity and uses petrol for long ones, so it suits home chargers who still road trip. An electric car, like the MG4, uses no petrol at all and suits anyone with a plug at home and predictable trips. Match the car to your driveway, then check the official range and charging figures for the exact model. Which one fits your week? https://www.cartell.tv/category/guides #cartell #newcars$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-wed-14-oct-pm-hybrid-phev-ev-explained-slide-1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-wed-14-oct-pm-hybrid-phev-ev-explained-slide-2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-wed-14-oct-pm-hybrid-phev-ev-explained-slide-3.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-wed-14-oct-pm-hybrid-phev-ev-explained-slide-4.jpg'],'2026-10-14T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-14-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: Hybrid, plug-in or EV? Match it to your driveway.$a$),
