('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$PRICE JUST DROPPED, and the clock is running. The Chery Tiggo 7 is $29,990 drive away in petrol, or $39,990 drive away as a plug-in hybrid, and both carry a $2,000 fuel card. The GWM Haval Jolion Premium is $23,990 drive away, down from $26,990, and the Haval H6 Lux Hybrid is cut by $3,000 to $37,990. GWM has also taken $4,000 off the Cannon Alpha diesel to $54,990, so check whether that price is drive away in your state. Every offer ends 31 October. Which deal would you check first? Chery: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/chery-tiggo-7-29990-drive-away-plug-in-hybrid-39990-2026-10-11 GWM: https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/gwm-october-sale-cannon-alpha-4000-off-haval-jolion-23990-2026-10-11$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-thu-15-oct-am-october-deals-end-31-oct-slide-1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-thu-15-oct-am-october-deals-end-31-oct-slide-2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-thu-15-oct-am-october-deals-end-31-oct-slide-3.jpg'],'2026-10-14T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-15-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: Two October deals end 31 October. Tiggo 7 from $29,990, Jolion $23,990.$a$),
