('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$AUSTRALIA CONFIRMED. The Mitsubishi ASX VR-e is an electric SUV arriving in late 2026, and the dual motor GSR is the fastest Mitsubishi ever sold here: 342 kW, 700 Nm and 0 to 100 km/h in 3.9 seconds. LS, Aspire and Exceed use a single rear motor with 171 kW and 350 Nm. Every grade has a 57.7 kWh LFP battery, DC fast charging up to 134 kW and vehicle to load. Mitsubishi has not announced Australian pricing or an Australian WLTP range. It will line up against the Kia EV3, BYD Atto 3 and Geely EX5. Would you buy a Mitsubishi EV? https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/mitsubishi-asx-vr-e-electric-suv-australia-342kw-gsr-2026-10-07$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-fri-16-oct-am-mitsubishi-asx-vr-e.jpg'],'2026-10-15T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-16-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: Fastest Mitsubishi sold here is electric: ASX VR-e GSR, 342 kW.$a$),
