('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$PRICE JUST DROPPED. BYD has a $4,000 cashback across 16 variants, covering the Seal 6, Sealion 5, 6, 7 and 8, and the Shark 6 ute. It takes the BYD Shark 6 Premium from $57,900 to $53,900 before on-road costs, and the Sealion 7 Premium from $54,990 to $50,990. You can take 0.99 per cent finance instead. Orders are open until 21 December, with deliveries by 31 December. Remember the cashback price is before on-road costs, so ask for the drive away figure. Is the Shark 6 on your ute shortlist? https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/byd-october-4000-cashback-shark-6-premium-53900-2026-10-02$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-sat-17-oct-pm-byd-shark-6-cashback.jpg'],'2026-10-17T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-17-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: BYD Shark 6 Premium is $4,000 cheaper. Now $53,900.$a$),
