('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$WHAT $42K GETS YOU. The Geely EX5 electric SUV starts from about $41,990 before on-road costs in Complete grade, with a 68.4 kWh battery, 160 kW and up to 475 km of WLTP range. It lines up against the BYD Atto 3 and MG S5, and Geely has the Starray EM-i hybrid and the smaller EX2 coming next. As always, ask for the drive away price, because $41,990 is before on-road costs. Would an EX5 make your shortlist? https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/geely-jumps-870-per-cent-ex5-electric-suv-41990-top-ten-2026-10-07$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-sun-18-oct-am-geely-ex5-from-41990.jpg'],'2026-10-17T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-18-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: An electric SUV for $41,990. Geely EX5, 475 km WLTP.$a$),
