('b1c2cd22-2fce-4027-91b9-2dbc6e129545','image',$c$WHEN CAN I BUY IT? The Polestar 4 SUV starts at $73,900 before on-road costs, and the first cars arrive in Australia in December. Polestar says its first allocated production run is filling fast. This SUV is built in Korea, through Geely's stake in Renault Korea, rather than in China. The existing Polestar 4 drops the rear window for a camera and an interior screen, so look at the version you are ordering. Would you wait for one? https://www.cartell.tv/reviews/polestar-4-suv-priced-from-73900-arrives-december-2026-09-27$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-sun-18-oct-pm-polestar-4-suv-73900.jpg'],'2026-10-18T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-18-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: Polestar 4 SUV is $73,900. First cars land in December.$a$),
('a3361798-cb41-46cf-8545-25b50e21a6fc','image',$c$WHEN CAN I BUY IT? The Polestar 4 SUV starts at $73,900 before on-road costs, and the first cars arrive in Australia in December. Polestar says its first allocated production run is filling fast. This SUV is built in Korea, through Geely's stake in Renault Korea, rather than in China. The existing Polestar 4 drops the rear window for a camera and an interior screen, so look at the version you are ordering. Would you wait for one? Link in bio. #cartell #polestar #polestar4 #electriccars #newcars$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/cartell/1013-sun-18-oct-pm-polestar-4-suv-73900.jpg'],'2026-10-18T07:32:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-cartell-2026-10-18-pm-instagram',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: Polestar 4 SUV is $73,900. First cars land in December.$a$),
('982e3b99-127f-460b-95c6-d82a689efadc','image',$c$$7,299 vs $2,399. That is the median price of a mid-drive e-bike against a hub-drive e-bike in the eBikeFinder directory. Mid-drive bikes (295 compared) come in at a median 85Nm, 25.4kg and 600Wh. Hub bikes (126) sit at 45Nm, 25.0kg and 468Wh. So the extra money buys torque and refinement, not a lighter bike. Examples: the Orbea Kemen Tour 30 (mid-drive) is $6,399 and the Leitner Riviera (hub) is $2,199. Medians cover bikes the brand declares road-legal in Australia, so confirm compliance with the seller. FINDER DATA, 585 bikes compared. Method: median of the 421 declared road-legal bikes with a motor type stated, directory read 12 Oct 2026. Would you pay triple for 85Nm? Full directory: https://ebikefinder.au/ebikes #ebikefinder$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/15da38d/posts/2026-10-13/ebikefinder/1013-2026-10-13-tue-pm-image.jpg'],'2026-10-13T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','r1013-ebikefinder-2026-10-13-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 12 Oct: full size contact sheet audit of every slide, sources per manifest (verified 12 Oct), white bg, no dashes, no repeat of 2026-09-28/10-05 manifests. Hook: $7,299 vs $2,399. Median price, mid-drive vs hub.$a$),
